      "end_ms": 12700,
      "text": "我要带你到处去飞翔飞翔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 12700,
      "end_ms": 15490,
      "text": "走遍世界各地"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 15490,
      "end_ms": 16900,
      "text": "去观赏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 19300,
      "end_ms": 20910,
      "text": "没有烦恼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 20910,
      "end_ms": 23120,
      "text": "没有那悲伤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 25600,
      "end_ms": 27240,
      "text": "自由自在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 27240,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "身心多开朗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 31940,
      "end_ms": 33580,
      "text": "忘掉痛苦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 33580,
      "end_ms": 36880,
      "text": "忘掉那悲伤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 38260,
      "end_ms": 42239,
      "text": "我们一起启程去流浪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 44600,
      "end_ms": 49840,
      "text": "虽然没有华厦美衣裳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 50840,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "但是心里充满着希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 56000,
      "end_ms": 62570,
      "text": "我们要飞到那遥远地方看一看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 62570,
      "end_ms": 67600,
      "text": "这世界并非那么凄凉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 68600,
      "end_ms": 75220,
      "text": "我们要飞到那遥远地方望一望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 75240,
      "end_ms": 81560,
      "text": "这世界还是一片的光亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 83020,
      "end_ms": 87300,
      "text": "民谣不要太在意节奏和那个那个唱法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 87300,
      "end_ms": 90980,
      "text": "只要它能形成和和声就没了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 96400,
      "end_ms": 98880,
      "text": "每次重复的时候都可以变着花的伤害"
